    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Dynamic programming</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid DP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/maximal-square/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 221</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Maximal Square</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Find the biggest all-1 square in a binary matrix and return its <b>area</b>. Let <code>side[r][c]</code> be the largest square whose bottom-right corner is (r, c); then <code>side = 1 + min(up, left, up-left)</code> for every 1 cell. One pass, O(m·n) time, O(n) space with a rolling row and one saved diagonal value.</p>\n"
  },
